# RC-002 — AI Conversation Experience

North star: **"That conversation helped me reflect."**

## Before changing AI chat ask

- Does the first message feel welcoming — not generic or robotic?
- Are responses warm, concise, and sectioned — not walls of text?
- Is memory used only when real — never invented?
- Do questions invite thought — not test the user?
- Do messages breathe with comfortable spacing and smooth animation?
- Does leaving feel complete — no pressure to continue?

If any answer is no — revise.

